# Netlify redirect for FamilyVault AI.
#
# This site hosts NO application and NO data — it only forwards visitors to the
# self-hosted instance on your own server. Replace the URL below with your
# domain, then deploy this folder:
#
#   netlify deploy --prod --dir=deploy/netlify-redirect
#
# Every path is sent to the VPS with a permanent (301) redirect. The homepage is
# served locally by index.html so the old link shows a short privacy notice
# before forwarding.
#
# Learn more: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/

# Root stays local (index.html) so the notice is visible.
/        /index.html   200

# Everything else → your self-hosted vault.
/*       https://vault.example.com/:splat   301!
